<ol>
    <li class="lt-chem-79446"><span class="mt-font-Times New Roman,serif"><span class="mt-font-size-12.0pt">Use the following default search parameters to run a Peptide Mass Fingerprint search in Mascot search to identify the protein with the file name AST4.</span></span>

    <p style="margin-left: 0.25in; text-align: justify;" class="lt-chem-79446"><span class="mt-font-Times New Roman,serif"><span class="mt-font-size-12.0pt">Database: SwissProt<br />
    Taxonomy: All<br />
    Enzyme: Trypsin<br />
