    Variable Modification: Oxidation of M<br />
    Protein Mass: leave blank<br />
    Peptide Tolerance: &plusmn;1 Da<br />
    Mass Values: MH<sup>+</sup><br />
    Monoisotopic<br />
    Report Top 5 Hits</span></span></p>

    <p class="lt-chem-79446"><span class="mt-font-Times New Roman,serif"><span class="mt-font-size-12.0pt">What protein has the highest score?<br />
