        <li class="lt-chem-79446"><span class="mt-font-Times New Roman,serif"><span class="mt-font-size-12.0pt">What masses were used and which were discarded? Explain your reasoning. </span></span></li>
        <li class="lt-chem-79446"><span class="mt-font-Times New Roman,serif"><span class="mt-font-size-12.0pt">Record the protein identity, probability score, molecular weight, pI, number of mass values searched and matched, and percent sequence coverage. </span></span></li>
        <li class="lt-chem-79446"><span class="mt-font-Times New Roman,serif"><span class="mt-font-size-12.0pt">Interpret the results.</span></span></li>
